---
// FeatureGrid.astro — Core capabilities with matching Lucide icons
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8">
  <!-- Card 1: Dynamic Assignment Rules Engine -->
  <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--sl-color-gray-5)] bg-[var(--sl-color-black)] shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-sm)] hover:shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-md)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#eef4f9] dark:bg-[#1b2a4a] text-[#293f55] dark:text-[#f59e0b] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="16" y="16" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/>
        <rect x="2" y="16" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/>
        <rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/>
        <path d="M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"/>
        <path d="M12 12V8"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--sl-color-white)] mb-2">Automated Assignment Rules</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] leading-relaxed">
      Configure declarative rules (Peer-to-Peer, All-to-Head, Self-Evaluation). Forms are dynamically mapped to evaluator-evaluatee pairs across committees without manual spreadsheet maintenance.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Card 2: Accomplishment Portfolio -->
  <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--sl-color-gray-5)] bg-[var(--sl-color-black)] shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-sm)] hover:shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-md)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#fff7ed] dark:bg-[#291800] text-[#f59e0b] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/>
        <path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/>
        <path d="M4 22h16"/>
        <path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/>
        <path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/>
        <path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--sl-color-white)] mb-2">Verified Accomplishment Portfolio</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] leading-relaxed">
      Ground evaluation scores in verified performance. Officers log tangible contributions with external proof links, verified by administrators before scorecards are finalized.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Card 3: Real-Time Analytics & Radar Visualizations -->
  <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--sl-color-gray-5)] bg-[var(--sl-color-black)] shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-sm)] hover:shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-md)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#eef4f9] dark:bg-[#1b2a4a] text-[#293f55] dark:text-[#f59e0b] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M3 3v18h18"/>
        <path d="M18 17V9"/>
        <path d="M13 17V5"/>
        <path d="M8 17v-3"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--sl-color-white)] mb-2">Multi-Dimensional Analytics</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] leading-relaxed">
      Gain deep insight into leadership, execution, and teamwork through multi-axis radar charts, category breakdowns, percentile rankings, and randomized anonymous feedback.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Card 4: Confidentiality & Immutable Audit -->
  <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--sl-color-gray-5)] bg-[var(--sl-color-black)] shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-sm)] hover:shadow-[var(--ipes-shadow-md)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#ecfdf5] dark:bg-[#064e3b] text-[#10b981] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/>
        <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--sl-color-white)] mb-2">Peer Anonymity &amp; Audit Trail</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] leading-relaxed">
      Strict database-level decoupling protects evaluator honesty without fear of social friction. Every administrative action is permanently recorded in an append-only audit trail.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
